  "user": "Fine. Back to that charge — what do I do next?",
  "answer": "I found two settled card payments to TechMart Online for the same amount:\n\n- **TX-0402**: EUR 240.00, 14 July 2026\n- **TX-0401**: EUR 240.00, 20 July 2026\n\nTo move forward, I need two things from you:\n\n1. **Which charge is the problem?** TX-0401 or TX-0402, or a different one.\n2. **What happened?** The dispute options are:\n   - **Duplicate charge:** you were charged twice for the same purchase. This would fit if both payments were for one order.\n   - **Service not rendered:** you paid, but the service was not provided.\n   - **Goods not received:** you paid, but the item was not delivered.\n   - **Unauthorized debit:** you did not make or approve the payment.\n\nOnce you tell me, I will run an eligibility check first. I will open a dispute only if that check passes, and I will confirm the details with you before I submit it.",
